# Allow Service Access Using Security Descriptor Tampering Via Sc.EXE | T1543.003 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_sc_sdset_allow_service_changes.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1 (Image="*\\sc.exe" OR OriginalFileName="sc.exe") CommandLine="*sdset*" CommandLine="*A;*" (CommandLine IN ("*;IU*", "*;SU*", "*;BA*", "*;SY*", "*;WD*")) NOT ParentImage="C:\\Hexnode\\Hexnode Agent\\Current\\HexnodeAgent.exe"
